# Ruta 23 (C9, contract 56), 16 x 46. column = i, row = j. The League gate house arrives at the SOUTH end (7..8, 45); the road runs north between two lines of trees to the Senda de Campeones (the cave mouth at the north edge,
# 7..8, 0). EIGHT BADGE GATES across it (rows 40, 36, 32, 28, 24, then 13, 9, 5): two stone posts and a GUARD on the centre column, fences on both sides; guard k stands there until the hero owns badge k (80 .. 87 in order: one guard per
# badge): the guard NPC has `hide_flag` = the badge flag, so with the badge the gate is open (a map load reads the flags afresh: the badge comes before the map is entered). A RIVER (rows 16..19) crosses the road between the fifth and the sixth gate:
# it needs the Hidrodeslizador (Surf, `@surf yes` for mapc's reachability), like the usual Route 23. Look: the badge road: grass and a 3-wide path, stone gate posts with the badge emblem, fences, league banners; trees on both sides.
@map ruta_23
@size 16 46
@interior no
@area ruta_23
@bg 0
@fill grass
@surf yes
@spawn south 7 44 N
@spawn north 7 1 S
@encounters grass rate=18
  dashkip 40 44 5
  dashmark 40 44 20
  jabhawk 42 46 20
  hoodcoil 41 46 40
  skyrrow 44 47 5
  tuskid 40 43 5
  tuskmash 40 43 5
  foldling 41 45 5
@end
# Open ground (contract 63, normal route): a step onto plain ground (not tall grass, water, a door, a ledge, an arrow floor) rolls this table when rand8 < 4 (4/256 per step).
@open_rate 4
# Roaming wild creatures (contract 55, rollout in 63): 3 creatures of this table wander the open ground (not the tall grass); touching one starts that wild battle.
@roam 3 table=grass period=1800
@encounters water rate=15
  smashrimp 40 45 40
  urchlord 40 45 40
  gobrawl 42 46 20
@end
@legend
  .  tile=grass
  =  tile=path
  g  tile=tall_grass
  _  tile=none
  y  object=tree
  ~  tile=sea_o
  F  tile=grass object=fence_j
  b  tile=path object=bgate
  f  tile=grass object=vflag
  s  tile=grass object=road_sign text=r23.sign interact=look
  X  tile=path
  N  tile=path
  i  item=prime_salve
  j  item=ultra_cristal
  1  tile=path npc=guardia id=guard1 face=S text=r23.g1 hide_flag=badge_cantera gate=yes
  2  tile=path npc=guardia id=guard2 face=S text=r23.g2 hide_flag=badge_marea gate=yes
  3  tile=path npc=guardia id=guard3 face=S text=r23.g3 hide_flag=badge_voltio gate=yes
  4  tile=path npc=guardia id=guard4 face=S text=r23.g4 hide_flag=badge_raiz gate=yes
  5  tile=path npc=guardia id=guard5 face=S text=r23.g5 hide_flag=badge_toxina gate=yes
  6  tile=path npc=guardia id=guard6 face=S text=r23.g6 hide_flag=badge_mente gate=yes
  7  tile=path npc=guardia id=guard7 face=S text=r23.g7 hide_flag=86 gate=yes
  8  tile=path npc=guardia id=guard8 face=S text=r23.g8 hide_flag=badge_nucleo gate=yes
  H  tile=grass hidden=vigor_flask   # F2 (contract 74): a hidden item
